DECIDE `What is my pensioner premium in income support where paragraph 9 applies to me` IS
    `Sch 3 (2): the pensioner premium for persons to whom paragraph 9 applies` `paragraph 9 applies to me`

@export What is my pensioner premium in income support where paragraph 9A applies to me (Sch 3 (2A))?
