      `someone is in receipt of a carer's allowance or carer support payment for me, or I or a partner satisfy the condition only by virtue of paragraph 13(3A)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is someone in receipt of a carer's allowance or carer support payment for you, or do you or a partner satisfy the condition only by virtue of paragraph 13(3A)?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my severe disability premium in income support` IS
    `Sch 3 (5): the severe disability premium` `the condition I satisfy` `someone is in receipt of a carer's allowance or carer support payment for me, or I or a partner satisfy the condition only by virtue of paragraph 13(3A)`

@export What is my disabled child premium in income support (Sch 3 (6))?
