GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my carer premium in income support` IS
    `Sch 3 (7): the carer premium` `the number of persons who satisfy the condition in paragraph 14ZA`

@export What is my enhanced disability premium in income support for children and young persons (Sch 3 (8)(a))?
GIVEN `the number of children and young persons for whom the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied` IS A NUMBER @desc For how many children and young persons are the conditions in paragraph 13A satisfied?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my enhanced disability premium in income support for children and young persons` IS
    `Sch 3 (8)(a): the enhanced disability premium for children and young persons` `the number of children and young persons for whom the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied`

@export What is my enhanced disability premium in income support if I am neither a child or young person nor in a couple (Sch 3 (8)(b))?
GIVEN `I am neither a child or young person nor a member of a couple or polygamous marriage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you neither a child or young person nor a member of a couple or a polygamous marriage?
      `the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied in respect of me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the conditions in paragraph 13A satisfied in respect of you?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my enhanced disability premium in income support if I am neither a child or young person nor in a couple` IS
    `Sch 3 (8)(b): the enhanced disability premium for a person who is neither a child or young person nor in a couple` `I am neither a child or young person nor a member of a couple or polygamous marriage` `the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied in respect of me`

@export What is my enhanced disability premium in income support if I am in a couple (Sch 3 (8)(c))?
GIVEN `I am a member of a couple or polygamous marriage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a member of a couple or a polygamous marriage?
      `the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied in respect of a member of our couple or polygamous marriage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the conditions in paragraph 13A satisfied in respect of a member of your couple or polygamous marriage?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my enhanced disability premium in income support if I am in a couple` IS
    `Sch 3 (8)(c): the enhanced disability premium for a member of a couple or polygamous marriage` `I am a member of a couple or polygamous marriage` `the conditions in paragraph 13A are satisfied in respect of a member of our couple or polygamous marriage`

